# CQ1: What are the main types of plastics and plastic debris?

# Description: This CQ includes two sub-questions, of which the first, given the possible reference of the term "plastics" to both pieces and materials, can be further partitioned into two other questions, resulting in: 
# 1) What are the types of plastic material?
# 2) What are the types of pieces of plastic?
# 3) What are the types of plastic debris particles? and their definitions?

# In order to retrieve all subclasses, ensure you run the SPARQL queries in an environment where automatic reasoners can run first.  This is necessary because SPARQL queries would not recognize classes that include the subclass axiom as part of more complex axioms and would retrieve only classes where the subclass axiom is directly expressed as an independent triple in the ontology. SPARQL queries do not automatically interpret OWL restrictions and detect only explicit triples.
# We generated and exported a TTL file containing inferred axioms of PlasticO by HermiT 1.4.3.456 via Protégé, and then performed SPARQL queries against this file. The runner scripts load this file.
# The inferred ontology file also contains all annotations, classes, and object properties from the ClimOO imports. Please ignore such materials and refer directly to the ontology file in the main repo directory for accurate details.
# The TTL file is findable into the same directory of this file, at the link: https://github.com/ClimOO/ClimOO-Ontology/tree/main/ClimOO%20material/competency%20questions/CQs%20-%20sparql%20queries/plastico%20sparql%20queries/CQ1/climoo-plastico-inferred-hierarchies-2026-09-11.ttl

# SPARQL query 1.1
PREFIX ClimOO: <https://www.w3id.org/climoo/climoo-plastico#>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
PREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>

SELECT ?subClass ?label ?definition
WHERE {
  ?subClass rdfs:subClassOf+ ClimOO:ClimOO_0000247 .
  OPTIONAL { ?subClass rdfs:label ?label }
  OPTIONAL { ?subClass skos:definition ?definition }
  
}
ORDER BY ?label

# SPARQL query 1.2

PREFIX ClimOO: <https://www.w3id.org/climoo/climoo-plastico#>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
PREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>

SELECT ?subClass ?label ?definition
WHERE {
  ?subClass rdfs:subClassOf+ ClimOO:ClimOO_0000253 .
  OPTIONAL { ?subClass rdfs:label ?label }
  OPTIONAL { ?subClass skos:definition ?definition }
  
}
ORDER BY ?label

# SPARQL query 1.3

PREFIX ClimOO: <https://www.w3id.org/climoo/climoo-plastico#>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
PREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>

SELECT ?subClass ?label ?definition
WHERE {
  ?subClass rdfs:subClassOf+ ClimOO:ClimOO_0000163 .
  OPTIONAL { ?subClass rdfs:label ?label }
  OPTIONAL { ?subClass skos:definition ?definition }
  
}
ORDER BY ?label

